Place large public source data files here.

This directory is gitignored -- these datasets are public and re-downloadable, and committing them
would bloat the repository without adding verifiability. See docs/DATA_SOURCES.md for what each
file is and where to obtain it.

The main one is Dominion's hourly load projection, accepted under any of these filenames:

    DOMLSEHourlyLoadProjections2024through2048.csv
    DOM-LSE-HourlyLoadProjections-2024-through-2048.csv
    DOM_LSE_HourlyLoadProjections_2024_through_2048.csv
